    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sure you can, but the colf will require a very large number of intercept parameters. It might be better to treat such an item as continuous and use the SEM framework. There is future work for mirt where I&#39;ll likely support continuous responses, but currently this is not available. <div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Phil</div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
